0.1 (unreleased)
  * Initial release.
  * Retry the controller reset when it times out.
  * Set and report output.level on every output channel.
  * Keep the identity address an LE device distributes when pairing.
  * Restart the scan when a reload adds a HID device.
  * Log when RTP packets start and stop being dropped.
  * Drive the keyboard LEDs from the state X sets on wskbd0.
  * Keep the headset's AVDTP signalling channel when both sides open
    one at once.
  * Report the battery level of keyboards and mice.
  * Keep a bond when the peer reports a missing key, refuse to pair
    a bonded device and add "btctl unpair" to pair it again.
  * Bound the SDP continuation state and the HID report map fields
    taken from the peer.
  * btd.conf(5): document LE devices that change address in pairing
    mode.
